# A farmer sows a free meadow node near his farm and harvests the ripe fields, on layouts/farm.jsonc.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh farm --layout layouts/farm.jsonc --fps 10
# The castle stands at 10,10, so its flag is at 11,11. The farm at 13,10 has its flag at 14,11, a road of three steps leads west to the
# castle's flag, and the farmer stands inside. Seven fields of the stages 0x69 to 0x7e stand on row 22. He searches the nodes around the
# farm, walks to a free one, waits, and sows it, and then the fields grow.
wait 0.3
expect-at 13 10 building
expect-at 14 11 flag
expect-count field = 3
shot placed 13 10 1 2

fast-forward until count field >= 4 max 40000
wait 0.3
expect-count field >= 4
dump field-sown
shot field-sown 13 10 1 2
